    <solution><m>( 0,3 )</m>, for instance, and identify the corresponding graph accordingly:
<me>\mathbf{F} ( x,y )= \left\lt  3 x+3,y \right&gt; \quad\Rightarrow\quad \mathbf{F} ( 0,3 )= \left\lt  3,3 \right&gt;\quad\Rightarrow\quad \text{Plot(2)}</me>



</solution>
